    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Day 1 · On arrival in Rio de Janeiro, transfer to your hotel. Rio is green hills, blue sky, beautiful bays, islands and marvellous beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city and certainly one of the most beautiful in the world. Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon are famous for their black-and-white mosaic promenades, where people play football and volleyball on the golden sand from early morning until late at night. Rio offers almost every sport, from golf and tennis to surfing, rafting, diving and hang gliding, while beach cafés serve coconut water and fresh juices to the sound of local musicians.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b8293c9fd8dba124f710b479bd4615528c6c6d3f8202d1ab4cdf38027ca7d13e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
